>    - `VISUAL_URL`: Default is `http://localhost:7002`.
> 
> 2. **Endpoints**:
>    - **POST `/process_signal`**: Processes incoming signals by generating a "thought trace", anchoring it to the ledger, and validating it with the visual listener. Returns the thought, visual response, and anchored data hash.
>    - **GET `/`**: Health check endpoint returning "Reasoner stub running".
> 
> 3. **Dependencies**:
>    - `express`, `axios`, `body-parser`, `crypto`.
> 
